! Elegant FODO -- EXACT scenario. KQUAD is an exact symplectic integrator of the quad Hamiltonian
! (N_SLICES=4 converges the long 0.5 m quad on the hot beam) + EDRIFT (exact drift). NOTE: KQUAD
! integrates in TRACE space (slopes x') with an achromatic drift -> flagged model_mismatch here.
! HOWEVER Elegant tracks TRACE-SPACE SLOPES (x, x') with an ACHROMATIC drift, not canonical momenta,
! so on the hot 100 mrad beam it is ~2.2% off ImpactX in sigma_x and shows no chromatic emittance
! growth -> flagged model_mismatch in the registry (a different model, NOT under-integration).
QF: KQUAD, L=0.5, K1=2.0, N_SLICES=4
D:  EDRIFT, L=0.1
QD: KQUAD, L=0.5, K1=-2.0, N_SLICES=4
BL: LINE=(QF, D, QD, D)
